to area with width (a number) and height (number), giving back a number:
    give back width times height
to greet who (text) giving back nothing:
    say who
to roll giving back a number:
    give back 4
to both with x (yes/no) and y (yes or no):
    give back x and y
to pick, giving back text:
    give back "x"
to average of scores (a list of numbers), giving back a number:
    give back scores added together divided by length of scores
to labels with rows (a list of lists of yes/no values), giving back a list of text:
    give back every row in rows as text
to flags with marks (a list of yes or no values):
    say marks
